name sr-vorl
category Package
revision 59333
shortdesc Class for Springer books
longdesc This package provides a LaTeX class and templates for books to
longdesc be published at Springer Gabler Research, Springer Vieweg
longdesc Research, Springer Spektrum Research, Springer VS Research, or
longdesc Springer VS Forschung. It may be used to produce monographs in
longdesc different formats and "several-authors-books" fitting the
longdesc conditions of the aforementioned publishers.
